    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty intense way to put it. so you're saying the technical skill actually doesn't matter as much as the message now? i'm curious if you think this is just a temporary phase or if we've actually reached a point where traditional beauty is just considered irrelevant in the art world?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
