      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The consensus among many critics is that this isn't a permanent replacement of skill, but rather a shifting priority where the political message often overshadows the technical demonstration. Traditional beauty is no longer the *sole* gatekeeper of value, but the absence of craft usually signals to the market that the work may be less serious or sustainable in the long term. It appears we are in a contentious transitional era rather than a fixed era where aesthetics are irrelevant.",
